var string[] MACRO_STRENGTH = array.from("Building", "Mixed fleet — Mixed picture", "Flagged — Building", "Flagged — Clear signal", "Clear signal", "Clear signal", "Mixed fleet — Mixed picture", "Mixed fleet — Mixed picture", "Flagged — Building", "Mixed fleet — Mixed picture", "Mixed fleet — Mixed picture", "Mixed fleet — Mixed picture", "Flagged — Building", "Mixed fleet — Mixed picture", "Flagged — Building", "Building", "Clear signal", "Clear signal", "Clear signal", "Clear signal", "Clear signal", "Clear signal", "Clear signal", "Clear signal", "Clear signal")
var string[] MACRO_CAUSE = array.from("If the Trump-Seoul framework survives into October without a North Korean walkout,…", "GC.1, GC, gold — If career staff departures accelerate and Senate confirmation votes stall,…", "Gold tests resistance as haven flows intensify. Silver lags on industrial drag.…", "If Google purchases start printing toward the vesting tranches,…", "If the slowdown sticks, Apple treats Taiwan optical supply as a security constraint and pays…", "Over 3–6 months GOOGL can rerate if cloud operating margins show silicon savings the 8-K…", "SMH, tech stocks, US stocks — Indonesian court conviction of Gojek founder in chromebook procurement…", "Semiconductors rally on confirmed chip demand, but mega-cap valuations already absorb most of the move.", "If the AI hardware buildout broadens through late 2026,…", "GC.1, GC, gold — If career staff departures accelerate and Senate confirmation votes stall,…", "GC.1, GC, gold — If career staff departures accelerate and Senate confirmation votes stall,…", "European utilities front-load LNG procurement; Henry Hub and Brent spreads break higher. CTA funds chase,…", "If the court standoff stretches into August without clean resolution,…", "intermediate bonds, dollar, EURUSD — Trend funds cover Treasury shorts,…", "EURUSD, HYG, BTC — US equity funds and bond benchmarks may rotate out of eurozone…", "USDJPY stays pressured into year-end as the US-JP rate gap keeps compressing on BOJ persistence.", "NZDUSD grinds lower as the kiwi-yen rate gap closes even with stable dairy prices supporting…", "If Trump's deregulation keeps rolling through H2 2026,…", "Natural gas rises as utilities lean harder on gas-fired plants to plug the capacity gap…", "Growth fund managers may rotate into IWM's tech and component names if hardware pilot announcements…", "If reshoring metrics keep improving, investors may treat CNH as a currency to short,…", "KIE, long-term Treasuries, intermediate bonds — If Indonesia's defense-grade procurem